The mods in this repository are original work licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

They are built as exlaunch modules. exlaunch (https://github.com/shadowninja108/exlaunch) is
licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0 and is not included here; you obtain it
separately when building. A compiled module (subsdk9) therefore contains exlaunch code, and that
portion of any binary is distributed under GPL-2.0 terms. This repository provides the source for
the mods' own code; exlaunch's source is available from its upstream repository.

Host tests use doctest (MIT), fetched by CMake at configure time. Builds use devkitPro's
devkitA64 toolchain.

No Nintendo game assets or code are included. The offsets and instruction words in the source
identify locations in the game's own executable and are used to verify the supported version.
